Package: irtse
Type: Package
Title: Information-Based and Exact Bootstrap Standard Errors for IRT Ability Estimates
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Che", "Cheng", email = "che830621@stat.sinica.edu.tw",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: For dichotomous logistic item response models with one or two
    item parameters, computes the information-based standard error and the
    exact parametric-bootstrap standard error of the ability estimate (the
    maximum likelihood estimate on responses that are neither all correct
    nor all wrong, and Warm's weighted likelihood estimate), by exact
    enumeration of the law of the sufficient statistic. Also evaluates the
    closed forms of the second- and third-order coefficients of the
    difference of the two scaled mean squared errors, the exact
    finite-length risk difference, and a provisional rule that chooses
    between the two standard errors.
